OL,3,GNEWSAKitchen table game becomes iPhone
OL,4,Aapp
OL,5,
OL,6,FA board game invented at a kitchen
OL,7,Ftable during lockdown has launched as
OL,8,Fan iPhone app.
OL,10,FCubeRoots Ivy is the first mobile game
OL,11,Fcreated by Simon Gummer from Horley.
OL,13,FThe 36-year old, who made the app based
OL,14,Fon a board game devised by his
OL,15,Funiversity friend Eddy Martin, likened
OL,16,Fit to "dominos".
OL,18,F"It is satisfying and easy to learn,
OL,19,Fbut surprisingly strategic," he told
OL,20,FBBC Radio Surrey. "It is your next
OL,21,F'just one more level' game. We have
OL,22,Fnever seen anything like it."
